{"ID":"20240205153749-t33f7ip","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"false","id":"20240205153749-t33f7ip","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205153749-t33f7ip\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206135626-jv20fp2\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240606170734-4n3r4y3\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:1000\u0026#125;","title":"008滑石","type":"doc","updated":"20240206135626"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206135626-jv20fp2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206135626-jv20fp2","updated":"20240206135634"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产山东、江苏、陕西等地。\n【性状】\t本品多为块状集合体。呈不规则的块状。白色、黄白色或淡蓝灰色，有蜡样光泽。质软细腻，手摸有滑润感，无吸湿性，置水中不崩散。无臭，无味。\n【性味】\t甘、淡，寒。\n【功效】\t利尿通淋，清热解暑，祛湿敛疮。用于热淋，石淋，尿热涩痛，暑湿烦渴，湿热水泻；外治湿疹，湿疮，痱子。"}]},{"ID":"20240206135626-ikod3m1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206135626-ikod3m1","updated":"20240206135626"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206135626-a6nongp.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240801094131-baggopr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240801094131-baggopr","updated":"20240801094131"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 768px;","style":"width: 758px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"滑石 (5)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/滑石 5-20240801094131-dpza3e1.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 758px;\" parent-style=\"width: 768px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240731195802-snby5ei","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240731195802-snby5ei","updated":"20240731200119"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"滑石 (4)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/滑石 4-20240731195901-s8yjtrr.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 333px;","style":"width: 323px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"滑石20240731_200102"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/滑石20240731_200102-20240731200119-bo70ne9.gif"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 323px;\" parent-style=\"width: 333px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240731195236-0jxbysg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240731195236-0jxbysg","updated":"20240801094010"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"注：真正的滑石质地很重，有蜡样光泽，软、滑、白透亮，一挤就碎；（最后两张图取图自抖音“"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"百草恒益"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"”）"}]},{"ID":"20240614152000-0aa2vso","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614152000-0aa2vso"}},{"ID":"20240614152234-5osruq4","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614152234-5osruq4","updated":"20240614152237"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"滑石《神农本草经》"}]},{"ID":"20240614152234-egkasla","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614152234-egkasla","updated":"20240614152234"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘寒。"}]},{"ID":"20240614152234-6g2w4yk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614152234-6g2w4yk","updated":"20240614152234"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主身热泄澼，女子乳难，癃闭。利小便，荡胃中积聚寒热，益精气。久服，轻身，耐饥，长年。生山谷。"}]},{"ID":"20240614152234-pyiuc9j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614152234-pyiuc9j","updated":"20240614152234"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《名医》曰：一名液石，一名共石，一名脱石，一名番石，生赭阳，及太山之阴，或掖北，白山，或卷山，采无时。"}]},{"ID":"20240614152234-n7hwuli","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614152234-n7hwuli","updated":"20240614152234"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"案《范子计然》云：滑石，白滑者善；南越志云：膋城县出膋石，即滑石也。"}]},{"ID":"20240614152344-ivfa84b","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614152344-ivfa84b"}},{"ID":"20240614152345-8gvqstd","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614152345-8gvqstd","updated":"20240614152351"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"滑石《神农本草经赞》"}]},{"ID":"20240614152345-0ngz51g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614152345-0ngz51g","updated":"20240614152345"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘寒。主身热溲。女子乳难癃闭。利小便。荡胃中积聚寒热。益精气。久服轻身耐饥长年。生山谷。"}]},{"ID":"20240614152345-szcpgew","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614152345-szcpgew","updated":"20240614152345"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"荡秽涤瑕。滑为滞导。上合三焦。两之九窍。可以乐饥。使我高蹈。白山卷山。鲜结皓耀。"}]},{"ID":"20240614152345-7lczpg3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614152345-7lczpg3","updated":"20240614152345"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"宋务先疏。涤瑕荡秽。黄庭经。上合三焦道饮浆。周礼。疾医两之以九窍。诗。可以乐饥。"}]},{"ID":"20240614152345-7nucra6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614152345-7nucra6","updated":"20240614152345"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"左传。使我高蹈。名医曰。生掖北白山。或卷山。水经注。粉水皓耀鲜洁。"}]},{"ID":"20240614152450-ja35al2","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614152450-ja35al2"}},{"ID":"20240614152451-s8rr6r9","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614152451-s8rr6r9","updated":"20240614152458"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"滑石《本草备要》"}]},{"ID":"20240614152451-go5hfno","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614152451-go5hfno","updated":"20240614152451"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"滑，利窍，通，行水，体重，泻火气，轻，解肌"}]},{"ID":"20240614152451-uzplv9i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614152451-uzplv9i","updated":"20240614152451"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"滑利窍，淡渗湿，甘益气，补脾胃，寒泻热，降心火。色白入肺，上开腠理而发表（肺主皮毛），下走膀胱而行水，通六腑九窍津液，为足太阳经（膀胱）本药。治中暑积热，呕吐烦渴，黄胆水肿，香港脚淋闭（偏主石淋），水泻热痢（六一散加红曲治赤痢，加干姜治白痢），吐血衄血，诸疮肿毒，为荡热除湿之要剂。消暑散结通乳滑胎（时珍曰∶滑石利窍，不独小便也。上开腠理而发表，是除上、中之湿热。下利便溺而行水，是除中，下之湿热。"}]},{"ID":"20240614152451-r6btmnk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614152451-r6btmnk","updated":"20240614152451"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"热去则三焦宁而表里和，湿去则阑门通而阴阳利矣。阑门分别清浊，乃小肠之下口。河间益元散，通治上下表里诸病，盖是此意。益元散，一名天水散，一名六一散，取天一生水，地六成之之义。滑石六钱，甘草一钱，或加辰砂。滑石治渴，非实止渴，资其利窍，渗去湿热，则脾胃中和而渴自止耳。若无湿、小便利而渴者，内有燥热，宜滋润，或误服此，则愈亡其津液而渴转甚矣，故王好古以为至燥之剂）。白而润者良。石苇为使。宜甘草（走泄之性，宜甘草以和之）。"}]},{"ID":"20240614152519-9eb5kxb","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614152519-9eb5kxb"}},{"ID":"20240614152529-0ct02x8","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614152529-0ct02x8","updated":"20240614152543"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"滑石《新修本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240614152529-icn5nrn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614152529-icn5nrn","updated":"20240614152529"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘，寒、大寒，无毒。主身热、泄 ，女子乳难，癃闭，利小便，荡胃中积聚寒热，益精气，通九窍六腑津液，去留结，止渴，令人利中。久服轻身，耐饥，长年。一名液石无时。"}]},{"ID":"20240614152529-151kmxp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614152529-151kmxp","updated":"20240614152529"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"石苇为之使，恶曾青。滑石色正白，《仙经》用之以为泥。又有冷石，小青黄，性并冷利，亦能熨油污衣物。今出湘州、始安郡诸处。初取软如泥，久渐坚强，人多以作冢中明器物，并散热人用之，不正入方药。赭阳县先属南阳，汉哀帝置，明《本经》所注郡县，必是后汉时也。掖县属青州东莱，卷县属司州荣阳。"}]},{"ID":"20240614152529-jtp4ogf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614152529-jtp4ogf","updated":"20240614152529"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔谨案〕此石所在皆有。岭南始安出者，白如凝脂，极软滑。其出掖县者，理粗质青白黑点，惟可为器，不堪入药。齐州南山神通寺南谷亦大有，色青白不佳，至于滑腻，犹胜掖县者。"}]},{"ID":"20240614152529-583mqif","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614152529-583mqif"}},{"ID":"20240614152520-f0gw46q","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614152520-f0gw46q","updated":"20240614152524"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"滑石《本草经集注》"}]},{"ID":"20240614152520-w706ngi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614152520-w706ngi","updated":"20240614152520"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘，寒、大寒，无毒。主治身热，泄 ，女子乳难，癃闭，利小便，荡胃中积聚寒热，益精气，通九窍六腑津液，去留结，止渴，令人利中。久服轻身，耐饥，长年。一名液石，一名共石，一名脱石，一名 石。生赭阳山谷，及太山之阴，或掖北白山，或卷山，采无时。"}]},{"ID":"20240614152520-if2x43n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614152520-if2x43n","updated":"20240614152520"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（石苇为之使，恶曾青。）"}]},{"ID":"20240614152520-o8hu97w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614152520-o8hu97w","updated":"20240614152520"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"滑石色正白，《仙经》用之以为泥。又有冷石，小青黄，性并冷利，亦能熨油污衣物。"}]},{"ID":"20240614152520-6anyu72","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614152520-6anyu72","updated":"20240614152520"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"今出湘州、始安郡诸处。初取软如泥，久渐坚强，人多以作冢中明器物，并散热人用之，不正入方药。赭阳县先属南阳，汉哀帝置，明《本经》所注郡县，必是后汉时也。掖县属青州东莱，卷县属司州荣阳。"}]},{"ID":"20240614152441-u6hmw8b","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614152441-u6hmw8b"}},{"ID":"20240614152505-pweveao","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614152505-pweveao","updated":"20240614152514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"滑石《本草图经》"}]},{"ID":"20240614152505-a9rggut","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614152505-a9rggut","updated":"20240614152510"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"滑石"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，生赭阳山谷及泰山之阴，或掖北白山，或卷山，今道、永、莱、濠州皆有之。此有二种，道、永州出者，白滑如凝脂。《南越志》云∶ 城县出 石， 石即滑石也。土人以为烧器，用以烹鱼是也。莱、濠州出者，理粗质青，有白黑点，亦谓之斑石。二种皆可作器用，甚精好。初出软烂如泥，久渐坚强，彼人皆就穴中乘其软时制作，用力殊少，不然坚强费功。《本经》所载土地，皆是北方，而今医家所用，多是色白者，乃自南方来。又按雷《炮炙方》滑石有五色，当用白色如方解石者。其绿色者，性寒有毒，不入药。又云∶凡滑石似冰白青色，画石上有白腻文者，为真。如此说∶则与今南中来者，又皆相类，用之无疑矣。然雷 虽名隋人，观其书乃有言唐以后药名者，或者后人增损之欤。或云沂州出一种白滑石，甚佳，与《本经》所云泰山之阴相合。然彼土不取为药，故医人亦鲜知用之。今濠州医人所供青滑石，云性微寒无毒，主心气涩滞。与《本经》大同小异。又吴录《地理志》及《大康地记》云∶郁林州布山县，多虺，其毒杀人，有冷石可以解之，石色赤黑，味苦，屑之着疮中，并以切齿立苏，一名切齿石。今人多用冷石作粉，治痱疮，或云即滑石也，但味之甘苦不同耳。谨按古方利小便，治淋涩，多单使滑石。又与石苇同捣末，饮服刀圭更快。又主石淋发烦闷，取滑石十二分，研粉，分两服，以水和搅令散，顿服之。烦热定，即停后服，未已，尽服之必瘥。"}]},{"ID":"20240614152505-umyr6pc","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614152505-umyr6pc"}},{"ID":"20240614152442-eee3qmz","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614152442-eee3qmz","updated":"20240614152446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"滑石《本草纲目》"}]},{"ID":"20240614152442-5ub7096","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614152442-5ub7096","updated":"20240614152442"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「释名」亦名画石、液石、石、脱石、冷石、番石、共石。"}]},{"ID":"20240614152442-t8n4ns1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614152442-t8n4ns1","updated":"20240614152442"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「气味」甘、寒、无毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240614152442-necad5e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614152442-necad5e","updated":"20240614152442"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「主治」"}]},{"ID":"20240614152442-4l351ye","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614152442-4l351ye","updated":"20240614152442"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、烦热多渴。用滑石二两，捣碎，加水三大碗，共煎成三碗。支渣留水，和米煮粥吃。"}]},{"ID":"20240614152442-nfy6rl2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614152442-nfy6rl2","updated":"20240614152442"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、女劳黄疸（下半天发热恶寒，小腹急，大便溏黑，额头变为黑色）。用滑石、石膏，等分为末，大麦汁送下。一日三次。小便大利即愈，腹满者难治。"}]},{"ID":"20240614152442-7dtrxj8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614152442-7dtrxj8","updated":"20240614152442"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3、伤寒症流鼻血（因汗出不来而流鼻血。如血色紫黑，不可止血，还要服温性之药。等到有鲜血流出，便急服本药去止住）。用滑石粉和米饭，捏成丸子，如梧子大。每服十丸，在口中稍稍嚼破，清水送下。血立卡。"}]},{"ID":"20240614152442-gv0wg30","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614152442-gv0wg30","updated":"20240614152442"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4、小便不通。用滑石粉一升，加车前汁，调匀，涂脐的周围，干了就换。冬天没有车前汁，可用水代。"}]},{"ID":"20240614152442-ggnssbo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614152442-ggnssbo","updated":"20240614152442"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5、妊妇尿涩不通。用滑石粉和水调匀，糊在脐下两寸处。"}]},{"ID":"20240614152442-i1uyr7u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614152442-i1uyr7u","updated":"20240614152442"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6、伏暑吐泄（小便赤色，心烦，口渴）。用好滑石（烧过）四两、藿香一钱、丁香一钱，共研为末。每服二钱，米汤送下。此方名“玉液散”。"}]},{"ID":"20240614152442-7plgi57","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614152442-7plgi57","updated":"20240614152442"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7、风毒热疮（遍身流黄水）。先用虎仗、豌豆、甘草各等分，煎水洗浴，然后用滑石粉扑敷身上。"}]},{"ID":"20240614152442-5a5kjq2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614152442-5a5kjq2","updated":"20240614152442"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8、下部湿汗。用滑石一两、石膏（煅过）半两、枯白矾少许，共研为末，干搽患处。"}]},{"ID":"20240614152442-pj33s4f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614152442-pj33s4f","updated":"20240614152442"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9、脚趾缝烂痒。治法同上。"}]},{"ID":"20240614152442-s8r1mfr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614152442-s8r1mfr","updated":"20240614152442"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"10、打伤肿痛。用滑石、赤石脂、大黄各等分，共研为末。热茶洗伤处后将药敷上。"}]},{"ID":"20240614152442-i32c5ba","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614152442-i32c5ba","updated":"20240614152442"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"11、热毒怪病（眼睛发红，鼻子肿大，喘气，浑身出斑，毛发如铁）。用滑石、白矾各一两，研细，加水三碗，煮成一碗半。不停地饮此水，饮完为止。"}]},{"ID":"20240614152442-itg1zre","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614152442-itg1zre","updated":"20240614152442"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"12、有些病可以用“益元散”（又名“天水散”、“太白散”、“六一散”）来治疗。"}]},{"ID":"20240614152429-k0yq3ty","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614152429-k0yq3ty"}},{"ID":"20240614152430-li3qyn1","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614152430-li3qyn1","updated":"20240614152434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"滑石《本经逢原》"}]},{"ID":"20240614152430-7bj7jyu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614152430-7bj7jyu","updated":"20240614152430"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"甘寒，无毒。色青赤者有毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240614152430-w32qo4v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614152430-w32qo4v","updated":"20240614152430"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本经》主身热泄 ，女子乳难癃闭，利小便，荡胃中积聚寒热，益精气。"}]},{"ID":"20240614152430-ddoexzf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614152430-ddoexzf","updated":"20240614152430"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"发明"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"滑石利窍，不独利小便也。上能散表，下利水道，为荡热散湿，通利六腑九窍之专剂。取甘淡之味，以清肺胃之气下达膀胱也。详《本经》诸治皆清热利窍之义。河间益元散通治表里上下诸热。解时气则以葱豉汤下。催生则以香油、浆水调服。暑伤心包则以本方加辰砂末一分，使热从手足太阳而泄也。惟元气下陷，小便清利及精滑者勿服。久病阴精不足内热，以致小水短少赤涩，虽有泄泻，皆为切禁。而《本经》又言益精气者，言邪热去而精气自复也。"}]},{"ID":"20240614152416-4oiihy4","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614152416-4oiihy4"}},{"ID":"20240614152417-l1krp7t","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614152417-l1krp7t","updated":"20240614152423"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"滑石《本草便读》"}]},{"ID":"20240614152417-ppags7i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614152417-ppags7i","updated":"20240614152417"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"甘淡性寒．清热有功于肺胃．分消质滑．导邪直降于州都．除湿热之稽留．宣表里而无滞．（滑石其性寒．其体滑．其质重．沉降下行．祛湿热．从小肠膀胱而出．有谓其燥者．亦湿去则燥之故．非滑石之性燥也．或谓其能解肌者．亦里通而表解之意欤．）"}]},{"ID":"20240614152406-w4wlgeg","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614152406-w4wlgeg"}},{"ID":"20240614152407-fncwn3r","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614152407-fncwn3r","updated":"20240614152412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"滑石《冯氏锦囊秘录》"}]},{"ID":"20240614152407-aqrnmn9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614152407-aqrnmn9","updated":"20240614152407"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"石中之得冲气者也，故味甘、淡，气寒，无毒。入足太阳膀胱经，兼入足阳明、手少阴太阳、阳明经。用质之药也。以滑为性，故利诸窍、通壅滞下垢腻，甘以和胃气，寒以散积热。甘寒滑利，以合其用，是为祛暑散热、利水除湿、消积滞、利下窍之要药也。"}]},{"ID":"20240614152407-qfk93vo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614152407-qfk93vo","updated":"20240614152407"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"滑石，利六腑之积滞，宜九窍之秘结，解烦渴，分水道，降火清肺，和胃消暑，散结通乳。然有湿便涩者，宜淡渗之。无湿者，宜滋润之，不可利也。且滑胎滑精，并宜知戒。"}]},{"ID":"20240614152407-onolc23","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614152407-onolc23","updated":"20240614152407"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主治（痘疹合参） 治痘热甚，惊狂谵语，利小便，通九窍，逐六腑滞结，退诸积热，解心火之毒热。不可轻用，致成冰伏。"}]},{"ID":"20240614152407-572fleq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614152407-572fleq","updated":"20240614152407"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"按∶洁古云∶滑则利窍，不与淡渗药同。时珍曰∶滑石利窍，不独小便也。上能利毛腠之窍，下能利精尿之窍，多服使人小便多，精窍滑。脾虚下陷者，尤宜忌之。"}]},{"ID":"20240614152356-stuxnwv","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614152356-stuxnwv"}},{"ID":"20240614152358-3pz421q","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614152358-3pz421q","updated":"20240614152402"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"滑石《本草求真》"}]},{"ID":"20240614152358-jkgumyp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614152358-jkgumyp","updated":"20240614152358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（石）降上中下湿热"}]},{"ID":"20240614152358-anu5fk3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614152358-anu5fk3","updated":"20240614152358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"滑石（专入膀胱）。何以滑名。因其性滑而名之也。滑石味甘气寒。色白。服则能以清热降火。通窍利便。生津止渴。为足太阳膀胱经药。故凡中暑积热。呕吐烦渴。黄胆水肿。香港脚淋闭。水热泻利。吐血衄血诸症。肿毒乳汁不通。胎产难下。服此皆能荡热除湿。通汁滑胎。（同甘草。为六一散。）然其开窍利湿。不独尽由小便而下。盖能上开腠理而发表。（腠理为肺所生。）是除上中之湿热。下利便溺而行。是除中下之湿热。热去则三焦宁而表瑞安。湿去则阑门通而阴阳利矣！河间益元散。（六一散或加辰砂。）用此通治上下表里诸病。其意在此。滑石既属渗利。如何又言止渴。因其湿热既渗。则脾胃中和。而渴自止耳。故书又载能理脾胃。义亦由此。白而润者良。石苇为使。宜甘草。（汪昂云。凡走泄之剂。宜用甘草以佐。）"}]},{"ID":"20240614152242-p1d2m21","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614152242-p1d2m21"}},{"ID":"20240614152244-q8wkmql","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614152244-q8wkmql","updated":"20240614152250"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"滑石《医学入门》"}]},{"ID":"20240614152244-pweufdq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614152244-pweufdq","updated":"20240614152244"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"滑石甘寒治湿热，利便兼通脏腑结，行积逐瘀下乳难，膈热身热多烦渴。"}]},{"ID":"20240614152244-ulkipo2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614152244-ulkipo2","updated":"20240614152244"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"石乃土之精，石滑而细腻也。无毒。性沉重而降，阴也，入足阳明经。燥脾湿，降胃火，主小便癃闭淋沥，通九窍六腑津液，上气令下行，荡胃中积聚食毒瘀血，而泄 自止。除隔上烦热身热燥渴，兼滑女子难产，下乳汁，妊娠小便转脬。白色者佳，余色有毒。研粉，或以牡丹水煮，飞过晒干。凡用必以甘草和之，石苇为使，恶曾青。"}]},{"ID":"20240614152306-8sd0qc4","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614152306-8sd0qc4"}},{"ID":"20240614152308-ciqrmlk","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614152308-ciqrmlk","updated":"20240614152312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"滑石《本草从新》"}]},{"ID":"20240614152308-3gmhzp3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614152308-3gmhzp3","updated":"20240614152308"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"通、利窍行水、体重、泻火．"}]},{"ID":"20240614152308-1cicf4b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614152308-1cicf4b","updated":"20240614152308"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"淡渗湿．滑利窍．寒泻热．色白入肺．清其化源．而下走膀胱以利水．通六腑九窍津液．"}]},{"ID":"20240614152308-wq7ld2d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614152308-wq7ld2d","updated":"20240614152308"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"为足太阳经本药．（膀胱．）治中暑积热．呕吐烦渴．（非实止渴、取其利窍、渗去湿热、则脾胃中和、而渴自止耳、若无湿、小便利而渴者、内有燥热、宜滋润、或误服此、则愈亡其津液、而渴转甚矣、故好古以为至燥之剂．）黄胆水肿．香港脚淋闭．（偏主石淋．）水泻热痢．（六干姜、治白痢．）吐血衄血．诸疮肿毒．为荡热除湿之要药．（时珍曰∶滑石上利毛腠之窍、是除中上之湿热、下利精溺之窍、是除中下之湿热、湿热去、则三焦宁而表里和、阑门通而阴阳利矣、河间益元散、治表里上下诸病、盖是此意、益元散、一名天水散、一名六一散、取天一生水地六成之之义也、滑石六钱、甘草一钱、或加辰砂．）"}]},{"ID":"20240614152308-ngh3qbt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614152308-ngh3qbt","updated":"20240614152308"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"消暑降火．散结．通乳滑胎．凡脾虚下陷及精滑者禁之．病有当发表者尤忌．（时珍、士材俱谓其能发表、 庵亦谓其气轻解肌、不过以其能利毛窍耳、不知表邪得此渗泄重降之品、必愈陷入里而成败证矣、切勿信以为然．）白而润者良．石苇为使．宜甘草．（走泄之性、宜甘以和之、嘉言曰∶天水散、取其一甘一寒之意也．阴下湿汗、滑石一两、石膏 半两、枯白矾五分、研掺之、脚指缝烂、方同上．）"}]},{"ID":"20240614152255-gtyi91q","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614152255-gtyi91q"}},{"ID":"20240614152256-1vuao5c","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614152256-1vuao5c","updated":"20240614152301"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"滑石《本草分经》"}]},{"ID":"20240614152256-k2z0a5l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614152256-k2z0a5l","updated":"20240614152256"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"淡寒滑，膀胱经本药，亦入肺清其化源，而下走膀胱以利水，通六腑九窍精液，除上中下三焦湿热，消暑降火荡热渗湿。"}]},{"ID":"20240614152332-gtm7jrc","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614152332-gtm7jrc"}},{"ID":"20240614152333-jkidi76","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614152333-jkidi76","updated":"20240614152338"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"滑石《汤液本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240614152333-v0570o3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614152333-v0570o3","updated":"20240614152333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"气寒，味甘。大寒。无毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240614152333-otoze8a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614152333-otoze8a","updated":"20240614152333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"入足太阳经。"}]},{"ID":"20240614152333-b3byw6t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614152333-b3byw6t","updated":"20240614152333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《象》云∶治前阴不利，性沉重，能泄上气令下行。故曰滑则利窍。不可与淡渗同用。"}]},{"ID":"20240614152333-53ryqo4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614152333-53ryqo4","updated":"20240614152333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白者佳。杵细、水飞用。"}]},{"ID":"20240614152333-turgy34","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614152333-turgy34","updated":"20240614152333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本草》云∶主身热泄 ，女子乳难，癃闭。利小便，荡肠胃积聚寒热，益精气。通九窍六腑津液，去留结，止渴，令人利中。入足太阳。滑能利窍，以通水道，为至燥之剂。猪苓汤，用滑石与阿胶同为滑利，以利水道。葱、豉、生姜同煎去渣，澄清以解利。淡味渗泄为阳，解表、利小便也。若小便自利，不宜以此解之。"}]},{"ID":"20240614152333-dlrznen","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614152333-dlrznen","updated":"20240614152333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《衍义》云∶暴吐逆，不下食，以生细末二钱匕，温水调服，后以热面压之。"}]},{"ID":"20240614152319-d97pgx2","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614152319-d97pgx2"}},{"ID":"20240614152321-86esamk","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614152321-86esamk","updated":"20240614152327"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"滑石《证类本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240614152321-s04ea9z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614152321-s04ea9z","updated":"20240614152321"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘，寒、大寒，无毒。主身热、泄 ，女子乳难，癃闭，利小便，荡胃中积聚寒热，益精气，通九窍六腑津液，去留结，止渴，令人利中。久服轻身，耐饥，长年。一名液石，一名共石，一名脱石，一名番石。生赭阳山谷及泰山之阴，或掖北白山，或卷山。采无时。（石韦为之使，恶曾青。）"}]},{"ID":"20240614152321-nx52tw8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614152321-nx52tw8","updated":"20240614152321"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"陶隐居云∶滑石，色正白，《仙经》用之以为泥。又有冷石，小青黄，性并冷利，亦能熨油污衣物。今出湘州、始安郡诸处。初取软如泥，久渐坚强，人多以作冢中明器物，并散热人用之，不正入方药。赭阳县先属南阳，汉哀帝置，明《本经》所注郡县，必是后汉时也。掖县，属青州东莱；卷县，属司州荣阳。唐本注云∶此石所在皆有。岭南始安出者，白如凝脂，极软滑。其出掖县者，理粗质青白黑点，唯可为器，不堪入药。齐州南山神通寺南谷亦大有，色青白不佳，至于滑腻，犹胜掖县者。臣禹锡等谨按药性论云∶滑石，臣。一名夕冷。"}]},{"ID":"20240614152321-sfmf3uq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614152321-sfmf3uq","updated":"20240614152321"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"能疗五淋，主难产。服其末，又末与丹参、蜜、猪脂为膏，入其月即空心酒下弹丸大。临产倍服，令滑胎易生。除烦热心躁，偏主石淋。陈藏器云∶按始安及掖县所出二石，形质既异，所用又殊。陶云∶不知今北方有之否。当陶之时北方阻绝，不知之者，曷足怪焉。苏恭引为一物，深可嗟讶。其始安者，软滑而白，是滑石。东莱者，硬涩而青，乃作器石也。南越志云∶ 城县出 石， 石即滑石也。土人以为烧器以烹鱼。日华子云∶滑石治乳痈，利津液。"}]},{"ID":"20240614152321-lxlzh52","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614152321-lxlzh52","updated":"20240614152321"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"图经曰∶滑石，生赭阳山谷及泰山之阴、或掖北白山、或卷山，今道、永、莱、濠州皆有之。此有二种，道、永州出者，白滑如凝脂。《南越志》云∶ 城县出 石， 石即滑石也。土人以为烧器，用以烹鱼是也。莱、濠州出者，理粗质青，有白黑点，亦谓之斑石。二种皆可作器用，甚精好。初出软烂如泥，久渐坚强，彼人皆就穴中乘其软时制作，用力殊少，不然坚《雷 炮炙方》滑石有五色，当用白色如方解石者。其绿色者，性寒有毒，不入药。又云∶凡滑石似冰，白青色，画石上有白腻文者为真。如此说，则与今南中来者又皆相类，用之无疑矣。然雷 虽名隋人，观其书乃有言唐以后药名者，或者后人增损之欤。或云∶沂州出一种滑石，甚佳，与《本经》所云泰山之阴相合。然彼土不取为药，故医人亦鲜知用之。今濠州医人所供青滑石，云性微寒，无毒。主心气涩滞。与《本经》大同小异。又吴录《地理志》及《太康地记》云∶郁林州布山县多虺，其毒杀人，有冷石可以解之，石色赤黑，味苦，屑之着疮中，并以切齿立苏。一名切齿石。今人多用冷石作粉，治痱疮，或云即滑石也，但味之甘苦不同耳。按古方利小便，治淋涩，多单使滑石。又与石韦同捣末，饮服刀圭更快。又主石淋发烦闷，取滑石十二分，研粉，分两服，以水和搅令散，顿服之。烦热定，即停后服。"}]},{"ID":"20240614152321-h4npyqs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614152321-h4npyqs","updated":"20240614152321"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"未已，尽服必瘥。"}]},{"ID":"20240614152321-3dfd39e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614152321-3dfd39e","updated":"20240614152321"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"雷公云∶凡使有多般，勿误使之。有白滑石、绿滑石、乌滑石、冷滑石、黄滑石。其白滑石方解石，色白，于石上画有白腻纹，方使得。滑石绿者，性寒，有毒，不入药中用。乌滑石似色，画石上有青白腻纹，入用妙也。黄滑石色似金，颗颗圆。画石上有青黑色者，勿用，杀人。冷滑石青苍色，画石上作白腻文，亦勿用。若滑石色似冰，白青色，画石上有白腻文者，真也。凡使，先以刀刮，研如粉，以牡丹皮同煮一伏时，出，去牡丹皮取滑石，却用东流水淘过，于日中晒干方用。圣惠方∶治乳石发动，躁热烦渴不止。滑石半两，细研如粉以水一中盏，绞如白饮，顿服之，未瘥再服。又方∶治妇人过忍小便致胞转。滑石末，葱汤调下二钱匕。又方∶治膈上烦热多渴，通利九窍。滑石二两捣碎，以水三大盏，煎取二盏，去滓，下粳米二合煮粥，温温食之效。外台秘要∶疗妊娠不得小便，滑石末水和泥脐下二寸。广利方∶治气壅，关格不通，小便淋结，脐下妨闷兼痛。以滑石八分研如面，以水五大合，和搅顿服。杨氏产乳∶疗小便不通。滑石末一升，以车前汁和涂脐四畔，方四寸，热即易之，冬月水和亦得。丹房镜源∶滑石能制雄、雌黄为外匮。周礼∶以滑养窍。注云∶滑石也。凡诸物通利，往来似窍。"}]},{"ID":"20240614152321-bug5bgr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614152321-bug5bgr","updated":"20240614152321"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"衍义曰∶滑石，今谓之画石，以其软滑可写画，淋家多用。若暴得吐逆不下食，以生细末贰钱匕，温水服；仍急以热面半盏，押定。"}]},{"ID":"20240614152000-ufarvpe","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614152000-ufarvpe"}},{"ID":"20240614152226-rq96jie","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614152226-rq96jie","updated":"20240614152229"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"滑石《本草崇原》"}]},{"ID":"20240614152226-uxqv8sq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614152226-uxqv8sq","updated":"20240614152226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"气味甘寒，无毒。主治身热泄癖，女子乳难，癃闭，利小便，荡胃中积聚寒热，益精气。久服轻身耐饥，长年。"}]},{"ID":"20240614152226-jyntods","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614152226-jyntods","updated":"20240614152226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（滑石一名液石，又名 石，始出赭阳山谷及太山之阴，或掖北白山，或卷山，今湘州、永州、始安、岭南近道诸处皆有。初取柔软，久渐坚硬，白如凝脂，滑而且腻者佳。）"}]},{"ID":"20240614152226-sak5wz6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614152226-sak5wz6","updated":"20240614152226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"滑石味甘属土，气寒属水，色白属金。主治身热泄癖者，禀水气而清外内之热也。热在外则身热，热在内则泄 也。女子乳难者，禀金气而生中焦之汁，乳生中焦，亦水类也。治癃闭，禀土气而化水道之出也。利小便，所以治癃闭也。荡胃中积聚寒热，所以治身热泄癖也。"}]},{"ID":"20240614152226-zpdy0ao","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614152226-zpdy0ao","updated":"20240614152226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"益精气，所以治乳难也。久服则土生金而金生水，故轻身耐饥，长年。"}]},{"ID":"20240614152000-tozr5g1","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614152000-tozr5g1"}},{"ID":"20240614152111-83s440l","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614152111-83s440l","updated":"20240614152220"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"滑石《要药分剂》"}]},{"ID":"20240614152111-nj057be","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614152111-nj057be","updated":"20240614152111"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘。性寒。无毒。禀石中之冲气而生。降也。阴也。石苇为使。制雄黄。"}]},{"ID":"20240614152111-tjhq29q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614152111-tjhq29q","updated":"20240614152111"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【主治】主身热泄。女子乳难。癃闭。利小便。荡胃中积聚热（本经）通九窍六腑津液凝血。解燥渴诸疮肿毒。（日【归经】入膀胱经。兼入心胃大小肠四经。为通利下窍之品（兼通剂）【前论】罗天益曰。滑石治渴。非真止渴。资其利窍。渗去湿热则脾胃中和。而渴自止耳。"}]},{"ID":"20240614152111-qbo00tv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614152111-qbo00tv","updated":"20240614152111"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"以为淡之膀胱热。"}]},{"ID":"20240614152111-fnf1mo7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614152111-fnf1mo7","updated":"20240614152111"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"和。"}]},{"ID":"20240614152111-s9nj6rk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614152111-s9nj6rk","updated":"20240614152202"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【禁忌】经疏曰。凡阴精不足。内热。以致小水短少赤涩。或不利。及烦渴身热。由于阴虚火炽水涸者,皆禁用。脾胃俱虚者,虽作泄勿服。"}]},{"ID":"20240606170633-db6gsot","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240606170633-db6gsot"}},{"ID":"20240606170731-o5tfm4v","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-o5tfm4v","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中国药典》：滑石"}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-aktnw9m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-aktnw9m","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"拼音"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Huá Shí"}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-74lzk0v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-74lzk0v","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"英文名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"TALCUM"}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-lqo5fnl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-lqo5fnl","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"别名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"画石"}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-vfbx6va","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-vfbx6va","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"来源"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"本品为硅酸盐类矿物滑石族"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"滑石"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，主含含水硅酸镁［Mg3（Si4O10）（OH）2］。采挖后，除去泥沙及杂石。"}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-9molrhr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-9molrhr","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性状"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"本品多为块状集合体。呈不规则的块状。白色、黄白色或淡蓝灰色，有蜡样光泽。质软，细腻，手摸有滑润感，无吸湿性，置水中不崩散。无臭，无味。"}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-kaw2mzz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-kaw2mzz","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"鉴别"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（1） 取本品粉末0。2g，置铂坩埚中，加等量氟化钙或氟化钠粉末，搅拌，加硫酸5ml，微热，立即将悬有 1滴水的铂坩埚盖盖上，稍等片刻，取下坩埚盖，水滴出现白色浑浊。"}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-sp13305","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-sp13305","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（2） 取本品粉末0。5g，置烧杯中，加入盐酸溶液（4→10）10ml ，盖上表面皿，加热至微沸，不时摇动烧杯，并保持微沸40分钟，取下，用快速滤纸滤过，用水洗涤残渣4～5次。取残渣约0。1g，置铂坩埚中，加入硫酸（1→2）10滴和氢氟酸5ml，加热至冒三氧化硫白烟时，取下冷却后，加水10ml使溶解，取溶液2滴。加镁试剂（取对硝基偶氮间苯二酚0。01g溶于 4％氢氧化钠溶液1000ml中）1 滴，滴加氢氧化钠溶液（4→10） 使成碱性，生成天蓝色沉淀。"}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-v0zxdhi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-v0zxdhi","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"炮制"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"除去杂石，洗净，砸成碎块，粉碎成细粉，或照水飞法（附录Ⅱ D）水飞，晾干。"}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-9dk68uc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-9dk68uc","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性味"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"甘、淡，寒。"}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-zkp4iyd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-zkp4iyd","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"归经"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归膀胱、肺、胃经。"}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-tg8dm70","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-tg8dm70","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"功能主治"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"利尿通淋，清热解暑，祛湿敛疮。用于热淋，石淋，尿热涩痛，暑湿烦渴，湿热水泻；外治湿疹，湿疮，痱子。"}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-zkxrtk4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-zkxrtk4","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"用法用量"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"10～20g。外用适量。"}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-qaxxzg0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-qaxxzg0","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"贮藏"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"置干燥处。"}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-n8ftbn7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-n8ftbn7","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"备注"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（1）用于小便不利、淋沥涩痛等症，可配车前子、木通等品；用于湿热引起的水泻，可配合茯苓、薏苡仁、车前子等同用。对暑热病症可配合生甘草、鲜藿香、鲜佩兰等同用；治湿温胸闷、小便短赤，可配合生苡仁、通草，竹叶等同用。此外，本品外用还能清热收湿，用治湿疹、痱子等，可配石膏、炉甘石，枯矾等同用。"}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-0iooqt5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-0iooqt5","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"摘录"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中国药典》"}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-jtt0ii2","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-jtt0ii2","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中药大辞典》：滑石"}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-ajbrpew","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-ajbrpew","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"拼音"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Huá Shí"}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-pmvpisn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-pmvpisn","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"别名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"液石、共石、脱石、番石（《别录》），夕冷（《药性论》），脆石、留石（《石药尔雅》），画石（《本草衍义》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-0sxq18r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-0sxq18r","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"出处"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本经》"}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-6tcbvw6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-6tcbvw6","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"来源"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"为硅酸盐类矿物"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"滑石的块状体"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。采得后，去净泥土、杂石。或将滑石块刮净，用粉碎机粉碎，过细筛后即成滑石粉。"}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-7h6rrpy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-7h6rrpy","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原形态"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"单斜晶系。晶体呈六方形或菱形板状，但完好的晶体极少见，通常为粒状和鳞片状的致密块体。淡绿色、白色或灰色。条痕白色或淡绿色。光泽脂肪状。解理面显珍珠状。半透明至不透明。解理沿底面极完全。硬度1，比重2.7～2.8。性柔。有滑腻感。块滑石能被锯成任何形状，薄片能弯曲，但无弹性。多产于变质岩、石灰岩、白云岩、菱镁矿及页岩中。"}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-o210e35","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-o210e35","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"生境分部"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"产江西、山东、江苏、陕西、山西、河北、福建、浙江、广东、广西、辽宁等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-dzmsehe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-dzmsehe","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性状"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"呈扁平形、斜方形或不规则块状，大小不一。全体白色、蛋青色或黄白色，表面有珍珠样光泽，半透明或不透明。质软而细致，手摸有滑润感，用指甲即可刮下白粉。无臭，无味，有微凉感。以整洁、色青白、滑润、无杂石者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-ljatnw3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-ljatnw3","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"化学成分"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主含硅酸镁，其中MgO31.7％，氧化硅63.5％，水4.8％。通常一部分MgO为FeO所替换。此外还含氧化铝等杂质。"}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-f0tbtze","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-f0tbtze","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"药理作用"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①保护皮肤和粘膜的作用"}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-v4io4ii","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-v4io4ii","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"滑石粉由于颗粒小，总面积大，能吸着大量化学刺激物或毒物，因此当撒布于发炎或破损组织的表面时，可有保护的作用；内服时除保护发炎的胃肠粘膜而发挥镇吐、止泻作用外，还能阻止毒物在胃肠道中的吸收。滑石也不是完全无害的，在腹部、直肠、阴道等可引起肉芽肿。"}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-2tvc3b7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-2tvc3b7","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②抗菌作用"}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-wzp9mzw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-wzp9mzw","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用平板法使培养基含10％的滑石粉，对伤寒杆菌与副伤寒甲杆菌有抑制作用；用纸片法则仅对脑膜炎球菌有轻度抑菌作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-exfpgcs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-exfpgcs","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"炮制"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"洗净，砸成小块，或研成细粉，或水飞。"}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-vk3dzeo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-vk3dzeo","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《雷公炮炙论》：\"用白滑石，以刀刮净，研粉，牡丹皮同煮一伏时，去牡丹皮，取滑石，以水淘过，晒干用。\""}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-hibx5zj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-hibx5zj","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性味"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"甘淡，寒。"}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-e5d66w1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-e5d66w1","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》：\"味甘，寒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-g8pxz7u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-g8pxz7u","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《别录》：\"大寒，无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-eihomif","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-eihomif","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《本草经疏》：\"味甘淡，气寒，无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-5nj9xyg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-5nj9xyg","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"归经"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"入胃、膀胱经。"}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-fzcnksv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-fzcnksv","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《汤液本草》：\"入足太阳经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-xcxgs7q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-xcxgs7q","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《雷公炮制药性解》：\"入胃、膀胱二经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-155thyg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-155thyg","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《本草经疏》：\"入足阳明，手少阴、太阳、阳明经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-k93jgvc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-k93jgvc","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"功能主治"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"清热，渗湿，利窍。治暑热烦渴，小便不利，水泻，热痢，淋病，黄疸，水肿，衄血，脚气，皮肤湿烂。"}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-q0cmrjc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-q0cmrjc","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》：\"主身热泄澼，女子乳难，癃闭，利小便，荡胃中积聚寒热，益精气。\""}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-nat3tje","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-nat3tje","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《别录》：\"通九窍六腑津液，去留结，止渴，令人利中。\""}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-ljuoklp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-ljuoklp","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《药性论》：\"能疗五淋，主难产，除烦热心躁，偏主石淋。\""}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-p31ur9z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-p31ur9z","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《日华子本草》：\"治乳痈，利津液。\""}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-nle7mhh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-nle7mhh","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤《本草衍义补遗》：\"燥湿，分水道，实大肠，化食毒，行积滞，逐凝血，解燥渴，补脾胃，降心火之要药。\""}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-9rcx9qe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-9rcx9qe","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥《纲目》：\"疗黄疸，水肿脚气，吐血衄血，金疮出血，诸疮肿毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-n977qsc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-n977qsc","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑦《本草通玄》：\"利窍除热，清三焦，凉六府，化暑气。\""}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-1wtk148","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-1wtk148","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑧《本草再新》：\"清火化痰，利湿消暑，通经活血，止泻痢呕吐，消水肿火毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-kbv6pge","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-kbv6pge","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"用法用量"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"内服：煎汤（布包），3～4钱；或入丸、散。外用：研末掺或调敷。"}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-hhc8gzb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-hhc8gzb","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"注意"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"脾虚气弱，精滑及热病津伤者忌服。孕妇慎服。"}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-cnwdftw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-cnwdftw","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本草经集注》：\"石韦为之使。恶曾青。\""}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-izp49n9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-izp49n9","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本草经疏》：\"病人因阴精不足、内热以致小水短少赤涩或不利，烦渴身热由于阴虚火炽水涸者，皆禁用。脾胃俱虚者，虽作泄勿服。\""}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-360rvtw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-360rvtw","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《药品化义》：\"渴而小便自利者，是内津液少也；小便不利而口不渴者，是热在下焦血分也，均不宜用。且体滑，胎前亦忌之。\""}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-n8g5y8q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-n8g5y8q","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《本经逢原》：\"元气下陷，小便清利及精滑者勿服。\""}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-z6a9lky","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-z6a9lky","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"复方"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①治身热吐痢泄泻，下痢赤白，癃闭，石淋；生津液，去留结，消蓄水，止渴宽中，除烦热心躁，腹胀痛闷，口疮，牙齿疳蚀，中暑，伤寒，疫疠：滑石六两，甘草一两（炙）。上为末。每服三钱，温水调下，日三服。惟孕妇不宜服，滑胎也。（《伤寒标本》六-散）"}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-7uxjiib","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-7uxjiib","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治热淋，小便赤涩热痛：滑石四两。捣罗为散。每服二钱匕，煎木通汤调下，不拘时候。（《圣济总录》滑石散）"}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-p8uk2my","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-p8uk2my","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③治气塑关格不通，小便淋结，脐下妨闷兼痛：滑石八分。研如面。以水五大合和搅，顿服。（《广利方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-vxzqswg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-vxzqswg","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④治产后淋：滑石五两，通草、车前子、葵子各四两。上四味，治下筛。酢浆水服方寸匕，稍加至二匕。（《千金方》滑石散）"}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-v3fpveu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-v3fpveu","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤治小便不利，茎中疼痛，少腹急痛：滑石、蒲黄等分。上二味，治下筛。酒眼方寸匕，日三服。（《千金方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-t6st0o1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-t6st0o1","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥治小便不利：滑石二分，乱发二分（烧），白鱼二分。上三味，杵为散。饮服半钱匕，日三服。（《金匮要略》滑石白鱼散）"}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-n252a84","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-n252a84","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑦治小便不通：滑石末一升，以车前汁和涂脐四畔，方四寸，热即易之，冬月水和亦得。（《产乳集验方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-du4zphm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-du4zphm","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑧治黄疸，日哺所发热恶寒，少腹急，身体黄，额黑，大便溏黑，足下热，此为女劳，腹满者难治：滑石、石膏各等分。上二味，治下筛。以大麦粥汁饮方寸匕，日三，小便极利则瘥。（《千金方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-7hlfupm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-7hlfupm","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑨治感冒久在太阳，致热蓄膀胱。小便赤涩，或因小便秘而大便滑泻。兼治湿温初得，憎寒壮热，舌苔灰色滑腻者：滑石一两，甘草二钱，连翘三钱，蝉退三钱（去足、土），生杭芍四钱。若滑泻者，甘草须加倍。（《医学衷中参西录》宣解汤）"}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-i8xvkh2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-i8xvkh2","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑩治伤寒衄血：滑石末不拘多少。饭丸如桐子大。每服十丸，微嚼破，新水咽下。只用药末一大钱，饭少许，同嚼下亦得。老幼皆可服。（《本事方》滑石丸）"}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-4oglxhc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-4oglxhc","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑾治暴得吐逆不下食：生滑石细末二钱匕。温水服，仍急以热面半盏，押定。（《本草衍义》）"}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-pwkk7p3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-pwkk7p3","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑿治热毒怪病，目赤鼻胀，大喘，浑身出斑，毛发如铁，乃因中热，毒气结于下焦：滑石、白矾各-两。为末，作一服，水三碗，煎减半，不住饮之。（《夏子益治奇疾方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-8yppzq6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-8yppzq6","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒀治妇人脬转，小便数日不通：滑石二两，寒水石二两，葵子一合。上药捣碎。以水三中盏，煎至一盏半，去滓，食前分温二服。（《圣惠方》滑石散）"}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-715bh5b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-715bh5b","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒁治天泡湿热等疮：滑石、粉甘草（此当半用为是）、上等分为末，搽敷。或加绿豆末，以治湿热肥疮。（《景岳全书》金黄散）"}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-lh5c59o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-lh5c59o","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒂治小儿体热痱疮：滑石末三两，白矾灰一两，枣叶四两。上药捣罗为末。先以温浆水洗疮，后取药敷之。（《圣惠方》滑石散）"}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-xx4oio4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-xx4oio4","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒃治脚趾缝烂：滑石一两，石膏（煅）半两，枯白矾少许。研掺之，亦治阴下湿汗。（《濒湖集简方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-svjtl95","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-svjtl95","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"各家论述"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《医学启源》：\"滑石，治前阴窍涩不利，性沉重，能泄气上令下行，故曰滑则利窍，不与诸淡渗药同。白者佳，捣细用。色红者服之令人淋。\""}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-7zgh612","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-7zgh612","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《汤液本草》：\"滑石，滑能利窍，以通水道，为至燥之剂。猪苓汤用滑石与阿胶同为滑利，以利水道。葱豉生姜同煎，去渣澄清以解利，淡味渗泄为阳，解表利小便也。若小便自利，不宜以此解之。\""}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-r9c98tl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-r9c98tl","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《本草蒙筌》：\"滑石治渴，非实能治渴也，资其利窍，渗去湿热，则脾气中和，而渴自止尔。假如天令湿淫太过，人患小便不利而渴，正宜用此以渗泄之，渴自不生。若或无湿，小便自利而渴者，则知内有燥热，燥宜滋润，苟误服用，是愈亡其津液，而渴反盛矣。\""}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-vaxzz4t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-vaxzz4t","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《纲目》：\"滑石利窍，不独小便也，上能利毛腠之窍，下能利精溺之窍。盖甘淡之味，先入于胃，渗走经络，游溢津气，上输于肺，下通膀胱，肺主皮毛，为水之上源，膀胱司津液，气化则能出，故滑石上能发表，下利水道，为荡热燥湿之剂，发表是荡上中之热，利水道是荡中下之热，发表是燥上中之湿，利水道是燥中下之湿。热散则三焦宁而表里和，湿去则阑门通而阴阳利。刘河间之用益元散，通治表里上下诸病，盖是此意，但未发出尔。\""}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-0lz3ctk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-0lz3ctk","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤《本草经疏》：\"滑石，滑以利诸窍，通壅滞，下垢赋。甘以和胃气，寒以散积热，甘寒滑利，以合共用，是为祛暑散热，利水除湿，消积滞，利下窍之要药。《本经》用以主身热、泄澼、女子乳难，荡胃中积聚寒热者，解足阳明胃家之热也。利小便癃闭者，通膀胱利阴窍也。《别录》通九窍津液，去留结，止渴，令人利中者，湿热解则胃气和而津液自生，下窍通则诸壅自泄也。丹溪用以燥湿，分水道，实大肠，化食毒，行积滞，逐瘀血，解燥渴，补脾胃，降心火，偏主石淋，皆此意耳。\""}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-bajl2do","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-bajl2do","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥《药品化义》：\"滑石体滑主利窍，味淡主渗热，能荡涤六腑而无克伐之弊。主治暑气烦渴，胃中积滞，便浊涩痛，女人乳汁不通，小儿痘疹发渴，皆利窍渗热之力也。如天令湿淫太过，小便癃闭，入益元散佐以朱砂，利小肠最捷。要以口作渴小便不利两症并鬼，为热在上焦肺胃气分，以此利水下行，烦渴自止。\""}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-aapeosw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-aapeosw","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑦《医学衷中参西录》：\"因热小便不利者，滑石最为要药。若寒温外感诸证，上焦燥热，下焦滑泻无度，最为危险之侯，可用滑石与生山药各两许，煎汤服之，则上能清热，下能止泻，莫不随手奏效。又：外感大热已退而阴亏脉数不能自复者，可于大滋真阴药中少加滑石，则外感余热不至为滋补之药逗留，仍可从小便泻出，则其病必易愈。若与甘草为末服之，善治受暑及热痢；若与赭石为末服之，善治因热吐血衄血；若其人蕴有湿热，周身漫肿，心腹膨胀，小便不利者，可用滑石与土狗研为散服之，小便通利，肿胀自消；至内伤阴虚作热，宜用六味地黄汤以滋阴者，亦可加滑石以代苓、泽，则退热较速。盖滑石虽为石类，而其质甚软，无论汤剂丸散，皆与脾胃相宜，故可加于六味汤中以代苓、泽。其渗湿之力，原可如苓、泽行熟地之滞泥，而其性凉于苓、泽，故又善佐滋阴之品以退热也。\""}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-wg3uz1b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-wg3uz1b","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"摘录"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中药大辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-jrrenaa","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-jrrenaa","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中华本草》《中药大辞典》：滑石"}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-rvhp008","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-rvhp008","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"拼音"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Huá Shí"}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-ruqm0y2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-ruqm0y2","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"英文名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Talc， Talc powder"}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-nwjaqm5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-nwjaqm5","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"别名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"液石、共石、脱石、番石、夕冷、脆石、留石、画石、活石"}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-pdnjkf0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-pdnjkf0","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"出处"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出自《神农本草经》；1.陶弘景：滑石，正白。又有冷石，小青黄，性并冷利，亦能烫油污衣物。今出湘外始安郡诸处。初取软如泥，久渐坚强，人多以作家中明器物，并散热，人用之不正入方药。赭阳县先属南阳，汉哀帝置，明《本经》所注郡县，必是后汉时也，掖县属青州东莱，卷县属司州荥阳。"}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-whvlsja","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-whvlsja","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《本草图经》：滑石，今道、永、莱、濠州皆有之。此有二种。道、永州出者，白滑如凝脂。《南越志》云，土人以为烧器，用以烹鱼是"}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-8lxtawg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-8lxtawg","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"来源"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药材基源：为硅酸盐类矿物滑石的块状体。"}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-1c4bxdb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-1c4bxdb","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：Talc"}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-44o6yz4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-44o6yz4","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：采得后，去净泥土、杂石。或将滑石块刮净，用粉碎机粉碎，过细筛后即成滑石粉。"}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-jhn0bw5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-jhn0bw5","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原形态"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"单斜晶系。晶体呈六方形或菱形板状，但完好的晶体极少见，通常为粒状和鳞片状的致密块体。淡绿色、白色或灰色。条痕白色或淡绿色。光泽脂肪状，解理面显珍珠状。半透明至不透明。解理沿底面极完全。硬度1，比重2.7-2.8。性柔，有滑腻感。块滑石能被锯成任何形状，薄片能弯曲，但无弹性。"}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-1vynsc5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-1vynsc5","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"生境分部"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生态环境：多产于变质岩、石灰岩、白云岩、菱镁矿及页岩中。"}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-3d7khkt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-3d7khkt","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源分布：产江西、山东、江苏、陕西、山西、河北、福建、浙江、广东、广西、辽宁等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-dubi09v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-dubi09v","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性状"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状鉴别 (1)滑石 为致密块状、鳞片状集合体，呈不规则块状或扁块状。白色、黄白色或淡灰色至淡蓝色。半透明或不透明。具蜡样光泽，有的呈珍珠光泽。质软细腻，可于硬纸上书写，手摸之有滑润感。无吸湿性，置水中不崩散。气无，味无，具微凉感。以整洁、色白、滑润、无杂石者为佳。(2)滑石粉 为微细、无砂性的粉末，白色或类白色。手摸具滑腻感。无臭，无味。以粉细、色白、无杂质者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-ltwsv9p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-ltwsv9p","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"显微鉴别 透射偏光镜下：薄片中无色透明。低正突起。最高干涉色可达Ⅲ级橙色，底面切片为Ⅰ级红紫。近于平行消光；正延长符号。二轴晶；负光性。光轴角小，一般在10°以内。"}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-1zxcgzr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-1zxcgzr","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"品质标志 《中华人民共和国药典》1995年版(一部)滑石粉“检查”项规定。(1)酸碱度 水煮的滤液遇石蕊试纸应显中性反应。(2)杂质含量限制 ①水中可溶物：取本品5g，加水30ml，煮沸30min，时时补充散失的水分，放冷，滤过，滤渣加水5ml洗涤，洗液和滤液合并，蒸干，在105℃干燥1h,遗留残渣不得过5mg(0.1%)。②酸中可溶物：取本品1g，加稀盐酸20ml，在50℃浸渍15min，滤过，分取滤液10ml，加稀盐酸1ml，蒸干，炽灼到恒重，遗留残渣不得过7.5mg(1.5%)。③铁盐：水煮滤液遇稀盐酸与亚铁氰化钾试液，不得即时显蓝色。④炽灼失重：减失重量不得过5.0%。"}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-mymyaje","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-mymyaje","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"化学成分"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.主含水合硅酸镁[Mg3(Si4O10)·(OH)2]或3MgO·4SiO2·H2O，其组成成分为MgO31.7%，SiO263.5%，H2O4.8%，通常一部分MgO为FeO所替换。此外，还常含有Al2O3等杂质。"}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-znqptj2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-znqptj2","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"药理作用"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.保护皮肤和粘膜的作用：滑石粉由于颗粒小，总面积大，能吸着大量化学刺激物或毒物，因此当撒布于发炎或破损组织的表面时，可有保护的作用；内服时除保护发炎的胃肠粘膜而发挥镇吐、止泻作用外，还能阻止毒物在胃肠适中的吸收。滑石也不是完全无害的，在腹部、直肠、阴道等可引起肉芽肿。"}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-evesq12","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-evesq12","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.抗菌作用：用平板法使培养基含10%的滑石粉，对伤寒杆菌与副伤寒甲杆菌有抑制作用； 用纸片法则保对脑膜炎球菌有轻度抑菌作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-6uyqbmq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-6uyqbmq","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"鉴别"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"取本品粉末0.2g，置铂坩埚中，加等量氟化钙或氟化钠粉末，搅拌，加硫酸5ml，微热，立即将悬有1滴水的铂坩埚盖盖上，稍等片刻，取下坩埚盖，水滴呈现白色浑浊。(检查硅酸盐)(2)取本品粉末0.5g，置烧瓶中，加入盐酸(4→10)10ml，盖上表面皿，加热至微沸，不时摇动烧杯，并保持微沸40min，取下，用快速滤纸过滤，用水洗涤残渣4－5次。取残渣约0.1g，置坩埚中，加入硫酸(1→2)10滴和氢氟酸5ml，加热至冒三氧化硫白烟时，取下冷却，加10ml水使溶解。取溶液2滴，加镁试剂(取对硝基偶氮间苯二酚0.1g，溶于4%氢氧化钠溶液1000ml中)1滴，滴加氢氧化钠溶液(4→10)使成碱性，生成天蓝色沉淀。(检查镁盐)"}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-rxntzdh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-rxntzdh","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"炮制"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.滑石《世医得效方》：“碎，绵裹。”《药品辨义》：“刮去浮黄土用。”现行，取原药材，除去杂质，洗净，干燥，捣碎。"}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-8al6reb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-8al6reb","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.滑石粉《雷公炮炙论》：“凡使，先以刀刮，研如粉。以牡丹皮同煮，一伏时，出去牡丹皮，取滑石，却用东流水淘过，于日中晒干方用。”《苏沈良方》：“水研如泔，扬去粗者存细者，沥干，更研无声乃止。”《医宗粹言》：“拣去粗者，择细腻者研为极细末，水飞入药，今粗入煎汤皆不作效。”现行，取净滑石碎块碾成细粉，或取净滑石粗粉加入多量的清水，研磨，搅拌，待粗粉粒下沉，细粉粒混悬于水中时，倾取上层混悬液，下沉部分再按上法反复操作数次，合并混悬液，静置沉淀，倾去上清液，将洗淀物晒干后再碾散。水飞石可使药物达到极细和纯净，便于内服或外用，以利水通淋，清热解暑为主。"}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-akps45k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-akps45k","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"饮片性状：滑石及滑石粉均参见“药材鉴别”项。"}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-gia5vak","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-gia5vak","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"贮干燥容器内，置干燥处，防尘。"}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-d03srfa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-d03srfa","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性味"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"甘淡；寒；无毒"}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-w3tvg72","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-w3tvg72","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"归经"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"胃；膀胱经"}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-4e5uqim","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-4e5uqim","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"功能主治"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"利水通淋；清热解暑；收湿敛疮。主膀胱湿热；暑热烦渴；小便不利；泄泻；尿淋涩痛；湿疹；湿疮；水肿；衄血；脚气；皮肤湿烂"}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-7e0oa5g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-7e0oa5g","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"用法用量"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"内服:煎汤，9-24g，包煎;或入丸、散。外用:适量，研末撒;或调敷。"}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-uudodx4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-uudodx4","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"注意"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"脾虚气弱，精滑及热病律伤者忌服。孕妇慎服。"}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-ayxqyiu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-ayxqyiu","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"复方"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①治身热吐痢泄泻，下痢赤白，癃闭，石淋；生津液，去留结，消蓄水，止渴宽中，除烦热心躁，腹胀痛闷， 口疮，牙齿疳蚀，中暑，伤寒，疫疠: 滑石六两，甘草一两(炙)。上为末。每服三钱，温水调下，日三服。惟孕妇不宜服，滑胎也。 (《伤寒标本》六一散)②治热淋，小便赤涩热痛: 滑石四两。捣罗为散。每服二钱匕，煎木通汤调下，不拘时候。 (《圣济总录》滑石散)③治气壅关格不通，小便淋结，脐下妨闷兼痛:滑石八分。研如面。 以水五大合和搅，顿服。 (《广利方》)④治产后淋: 滑石五两，通草、车前子、葵子各四两。上四味，治下筛。 酢浆水服方寸匕，稍加至二匕。 (《千金方》滑石散)⑤治小便不利，茎中疼痛，少腹急痛: 滑石、蒲黄等分。上二味，治下筛。酒服方寸匕，日三服。 ( 《千金方》)⑥治小便不利: 滑石二分，乱发二分(烧)，白鱼二分。上三味，杵为数。饮服半钱匕，日三服。(《金匮要略》滑石白鱼散)⑦治小便不通: 滑石末一升，以车前汁和涂脐四畔，方四寸，热即易之，冬月水和亦得。 (《产乳集验方》)⑧治黄疸，日晡所发热恶寒，少腹急，身体黄，额黑，大便溏黑，足下热，此为女劳，腹满者难治: 滑石、石膏各等分上二味，治下筛。 以大麦粥汁饮方寸匕，日三，小便极利贝瘥。 (《千金方》)⑨治感冒久在太阳，致热蓄膀胱，小便赤涩，或因小便秘而大便滑泻。兼治湿温初得，憎寒壮热，舌苔灰色滑腻者滑石一两，甘草二钱，连翘三钱，蝉退三钱(去足、土)，生杭芍四钱。若滑泻者，甘草须加倍。 (《医学衷中参西录》宣解汤)⑩治伤寒衄血: 滑石末不拘多少。 饭丸如桐子大。每服十丸，微嚼破，新水咽下。只用药末一大钱，饭少许，同嚼下亦得。老幼皆可服。 (《本事方》滑石丸)(11)治暴得吐逆不下食: 生滑石细末二钱匕。温水服，仍急以热面半盏，押定。 (《本草衍义》)(12)治热毒怪病，目赤鼻胀，大喘，浑身出斑，毛发如铁，刀因中热，毒气结于下焦， 滑石、白矾各一两。 为末，作一服水三碗，煎减半，不住饮之。 (《夏子益治奇疾方》)(13)治妇人脬转，小便数日不通: 滑石二两，寒水石二两葵子一合。上药捣碎。 以水三中盏，煎至一盏半，去滓，食前分温二服。 (《圣惠方》滑石散)(14)治天泡湿热等疮: 滑石、粉甘草(此当半用为是)。上等分为末，搽敷。或加绿豆末， 以治湿热肥疮。 (《景岳全书金黄散)(15)治小儿体热痱疮: 滑石末三两， 白矾灰一两，枣叶四两。上药捣罗为末。先以温浆水流疮，后取药敷之。(《圣惠方》滑石散)(16)治脚趾缝烂: 滑石一两，石膏(煅)半两，枯白矾少许研掺之，亦治阴下湿汗。(《濒湖集简方》)"}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-nzrf1mb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-nzrf1mb","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"各家论述"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.《医学启源》：滑石，治前阴窍涩不利性沉重，能泄气上令下行，故曰滑则利窍，不与诸淡渗药同白者佳，捣细用。色红者服之令人淋。"}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-ufmjm2d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-ufmjm2d","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《汤液本草》：滑石，滑能利窍， 以通水道， 为至燥之剂。猪苓汤用滑石与阿胶同为滑利，以利水道。葱豉生姜同煎，去渣澄清以解利，淡味渗泄为阳，解表利小便也。若小便自利，不宜以此解之。"}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-0monwdu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-0monwdu","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《本草蒙筌》：滑石治渴，非实能治渴也，资其利窍，渗去湿热，则脾气中和，而渴自止尔。假如天令湿淫太过，人患小便不利而渴，正宜用此以渗泄之，渴自不生。若或无湿小便自利而渴者，则知内有燥热，燥宜滋润，苟误服用，是愈亡其律液，而渴反盛矣。"}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-0h0prts","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-0h0prts","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.《纲目》：滑石利窍，不独小便也，上能利毛腠之窍，下能利精溺之窍。盖甘谈之味，先入于胃，渗走经络，游溢津气，上输于肺，下通膀胱，肺主皮毛，为水之上源，膀胱司津液，气化则能出，故滑石上能发表，下利水道，为荡热燥湿之剂，发表是荡上中之热，利水道是荡中下之热，发表是燥上中之湿，利水道是燥中下之湿。热散则三焦宁而表里和，湿去则阑门通而阴阳利。刘河间之用益元散，通治表里上下诸病，盖是此意，但未发出尔。"}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-895whyr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-895whyr","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.《本草经疏》：滑石，滑以利诸窍，通壅滞，下垢腻。甘以和胃气，寒以散积热，甘寒滑利，以合其用，是为祛暑热，利水除湿，消积滞，利下窍之要药。《本经》用以主身热泄BI、女子乳难，荡胃中积聚寒热者，解足阳明胃家之热也利小便癃闭者，通膀膛胱利明窍也。《别录》通九窍津液，去结，止渴，令人利中者，湿热解则胃气和而津液自生，下窍则诸壅自泄也。丹溪用以燥湿，分水道，实大肠，化食毒，积滞，逐瘀血，解燥渴，补脾胃，降心火，偏主石淋， 皆此耳。"}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-vrwo3p4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-vrwo3p4","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6.《药品化义》：滑石体滑主利窍，味淡主渗热，能荡涤六腑而无克伐之弊。主治暑气烦渴，胃中积滞，便浊涩痛，女人乳汁不通，小儿痘疹发渴，皆利窍渗热之力也。如天令湿淫太过，小便癃闭，入益元散佐以朱砂，利小肠最捷。要以口作渴小便不利两症并见，为热在上焦肺胃气分，以此利水下行，烦渴自止。"}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-90ubllj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-90ubllj","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7.《医学衷中参西录》：因热小便不利者，滑石最为要药。若寒温外感诸证，上焦燥热，下焦滑泻无度，最为危险之候，可用滑石与生山药各两许，煎汤服之，则上能清热，下能止泻，莫不随手奏效。又：外感大热已退而阴亏脉数不能自复者，可于大滋真阴药中少加滑石，则外感余热不至为滋补之药逗留，仍可从小便泻出，则其病必易愈。若与甘草为末服之，善治受暑及热痢；若与赭石为末服之，善治因热吐血衄血；若其人蕴有湿热，周身漫肿，心腹膨胀，小便不利者，可用滑石与士狗研为散服之，小便通利，肿胀自消；至内伤阴虚作热，宜用六味地黄汤以滋阴者，亦可加滑石以代草、泽，则退热较速。盖滑石虽为石类，而其质甚软，无论汤剂丸散，皆与脾胃相宜，故可加于六味汤中以代苓、泽。其渗湿之力，原可如苓、泽行熟地之滞泥，而其性凉于茶、泽，故又善佐滋阴之品以退热也。"}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-xscm0zd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-xscm0zd","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8.《本经》：主身热泄癖，女子乳难，癃闭，利小便，荡胃中积聚寒热，益精气。"}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-qai3qdj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-qai3qdj","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9.《别录》：通九窍六腑津液，去留结，止渴，令入利中。"}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-icawx22","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-icawx22","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"10.《药性论》：能疗五淋，主难产， 除烦热心躁，偏主石淋。"}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-dagj1yj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-dagj1yj","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"11.《日华子本草》：治乳痈，利津液。"}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-9ztvq44","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-9ztvq44","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"12.《本草衍义补遗》：燥湿，分水道，实大肠，化食毒，行积滞，逐凝血，解燥渴，补脾胃，降心火之要药。"}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-u62pskh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-u62pskh","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"13.《纲目》：疗黄疸，水肿脚气，吐血衄血，金疮出血，诸疮肿毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-j0onaru","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-j0onaru","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"14.《本草通玄》：利窍除热，清三焦，凉六府，化暑气。"}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-x8z7qbe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-x8z7qbe","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"15.《本草再新》：清火化痰，利湿消暑，通经活血，止泻痢呕吐，消水肿火毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-6wj9fpg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-6wj9fpg","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"临床应用"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.六一散:滑石粉600g，甘草100g。以上二味，甘草粉碎成细粉，与滑石粉混匀，过筛，即得。本品为淡黄色粉末，具甘草甜味，手捻有润滑感。显微特征:不规则块片无色，层层剥落痕迹。纤维束周围薄壁细胞含草酸钙方晶，形成晶纤维。功能清暑利湿。用于暑热身倦，口渴泄泻，小便黄少;外治痱子刺痒。调服或包煎服，每次6-9g，每日1-2次;外用扑撒患处。[《中华人民共和国药典》1985年;《北京市药品标准》1983年]2.益元散:滑石粉60份，甘草10份，朱砂3份。以上三味，除滑石粉外，朱砂、甘草分别粉碎成细粉，与上述滑石粉配研，过筛，混匀，分装成每包6g。本品为浅红色的粉末;具甘草甜味，手捻有润滑感。显微特征:不规则块片，无色，有层层剥落痕迹;纤维束薄壁细胞含草酸钙方晶，形成晶纤维;不规则细小颗粒暗棕红色，有光泽，边缘暗黑色;取本品加盐酸与氯仿，回流1h，滤液蒸干，残渣加乙醇使溶解，作为供试品溶液;另取甘草次酸对照片，加无水乙醇制成每1ml含1mg的溶液，作为对照品溶液，吸取上述两种溶液各5ml，分别点于同一硅胶G薄层板上，以石油醚(30-60℃)一苯一醋酸乙酯一冰醋酸(10:20:7:0.5)为展开剂，以10%磷钥酸乙醇溶液为显色剂。供试品色谱中，在与对照品色谱相应的位置上，显相同颜色的斑点。功能清暑利湿，除烦。主治暑热身倦，心烦口渴，小便黄少。调服或煎服，每次6g，每日1-2次。(《北京市药品标准》1983年)3.碧玉散:滑石(飞)600g，青黛35g，甘草100g。以上三味，各研细粉，过60目筛。各取净粉，混匀，即得。本品为灰白色粉末;味微甘。功能清暑热，平肝火。用于暑热蕴积，烦渴引饮，肝火旺盛，小便短赤。口服，每次12g，每日1-2次，布袋包煎。(《上海市药品标准》1980年)4.温六散:滑石(飞)600g，干姜50g，甘草100g。以上三味，各研细粉，过60目筛。和匀，即得。本品为米黄色粉末;味微甘带辛。功能祛暑散寒，除呕止泻。用于暑月受寒，呕吐泄泻。口服，每次9g，每日1-2次，布袋包煎。(《上海市药品标准》1980年)5.天水散:滑石(飞)600g，甘草100g，寒水石100g。以上三味，分别研细粉，过筛，混匀，即得。本品为米黄色粉末，味微甘。功能清热解渴。用于身热烦闷，口渴引饮。口服，每次9g，每日1-2次，布袋包煎。(《上海市药品标准》1980年)6. 鸡苏散:滑石(飞)600g，薄荷60g，甘草100g。以上三味，薄荷、甘草混合，粉碎成细粉，再与滑石粉混合，过60目筛，混匀，即得。本品为淡灰白色至淡青黄色的粉末;气微香，味微甘，有清凉感。功能清暑利湿，散风。用于外感暑风，头痛发热，小便不利。口服，每次9-15g，每日1-2次，布袋包煎。(《浙江省药品标准》1983年)"}]},{"ID":"20240606170731-qzncw0z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170731-qzncw0z","updated":"20240606170731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"摘录"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中华本草》《中药大辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240606170733-w8dllwl","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240606170733-w8dllwl"}},{"ID":"20240606170734-4n3r4y3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240606170734-4n3r4y3"}}]}